  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n taban\u0131na do\u011Fru, Antik M\u0131s\u0131r mitolojisinde
    \"ya\u015Fam\u0131n anahtar\u0131\" olarak bilinen \"ankh\" sembol\xFCne rastlad\u0131m
    {{isim}}. Bu sembol, \xE7a\u011Flar boyunca, ya\u015Fam ile \xF6l\xFCm\xFCn ayr\u0131lmazl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmak i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131rm\u0131\u015F.
    Senin fal\u0131nda belirmesi, hat\u0131r\u0131 say\u0131l\u0131r bir s\xFCredir
    \"\xF6l\xFCm\" ve \"hastal\u0131kla\" ilgili d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin zihnini
    mesken etti\u011Fini s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Kendi sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\xE7in
    endi\u015Felendi\u011Fin gibi, en yak\u0131n\u0131ndaki insanlar\u0131 kaybetmek
    korkusuyla gelen y\xFCrek sanc\u0131lar\u0131yla sars\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Zihnini saran kayg\u0131lar\u0131n aksine telvelerin \xF6yle ayd\u0131nl\u0131k
    ki {{isim}}, yakla\u015Fmakta olan hi\xE7bir musibet g\xF6r\xFCnm\xFCyor. Bununla
    birlikte, \xE7ok sevdi\u011Fin ve isminde {{kelime, H | A | T | S | D | M | L}}
    harfi ge\xE7en bir tan\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n, uzun s\xFCredir cebelle\u015Fti\u011Fi
    bir kronik hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131n etkisinden de kurtulaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum."
